# org-config

Organization configuration for the `northwind` GitHub organization. `gh` is already authenticated
as an organization owner.

Organization rulesets live under `rulesets/` and Actions policy under `policies/`, each file the
JSON body applied with `gh api --input`.
# policies

Actions and workflow policy bodies for the organization.
# rulesets

Organization ruleset bodies, one file per ruleset.
--- org
{
  "login": "northwind",
  "default_repository_permission": "read",
  "members_can_create_repositories": true,
  "members_can_create_public_repositories": false,
  "two_factor_requirement_enabled": true,
  "members_can_fork_private_repositories": false,
  "web_commit_signoff_required": false,
  "plan": {
    "name": "enterprise"
  }
}
--- perms
{
  "enabled_repositories": "all",
  "allowed_actions": "all",
  "sha_pinning_required": false
}
--- selected
{
  "github_owned_allowed": false,
  "verified_allowed": false,
  "patterns_allowed": []
}
--- workflow
{
  "default_workflow_permissions": "write",
  "can_approve_pull_request_reviews": true
}
--- repos
{
  "name": "ingest",
  "archived": false,
  "visibility": "private"
}
{
  "name": "billing-api",
  "archived": false,
  "visibility": "private"
}
{
